Subject: [PATCH 3163/3799] soh: rename D_8015E530 -> sQuadVsQuadAcTris

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the two triangles the AC quad is split into in CollisionCheck_AC_QuadVsQuad
Defined in soh/src/code/z_collision_check.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_collision_check.c | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_collision_check.c b/soh/src/code/z_collision_check.c
index 39ecafcae..d4683fa07 100644
